    "name": "No Way Out: 13",
    "steam_appid": 3424540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Endless Commute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be another mundane journey home, but something felt off.<br>The people in the station moved unnaturally, like puppets on invisible strings.<br>The same stations seemed to appear again and again, slightly distorted with each pass.<br>This place\u2026 something was terribly wrong. <br>Every decision matters, and time is running out. Escape before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the <strong>13th Station</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move in the direction that matches the presence or absence of anomalies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an anomaly is detected (O):<strong> </strong>Move in <strong>the backward direction</strong> \u2192 Travel 2 stations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no anomaly is detected (X): Move in <strong>the forward direction</strong> \u2192 Travel 1 station.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move beyond the final station, you will be transferred to <strong>\u2018First\u2019 Stage</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your current location on the <strong>yellow Current Station Board.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>13 Endings\u00a0&amp; Achievements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice leads to one of <strong>13 unique endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>13 achievements</strong> tied to each ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the endings you have obtained on <strong>the green Ending Tracker.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Observe, Deduce, Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe:</strong> Pay attention to unsettling anomalies at each station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deduce:</strong> Make the right decisions to advance to the next station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive:</strong> Escape the loop and uncover the truth before it consumes you.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Endless Commute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be another mundane journey home, but something felt off.<br>The people in the station moved unnaturally, like puppets on invisible strings.<br>The same stations seemed to appear again and again, slightly distorted with each pass.<br>This place\u2026 something was terribly wrong. <br>Every decision matters, and time is running out. Escape before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the <strong>13th Station</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move in the direction that matches the presence or absence of anomalies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an anomaly is detected (O):<strong> </strong>Move in <strong>the backward direction</strong> \u2192 Travel 2 stations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no anomaly is detected (X): Move in <strong>the forward direction</strong> \u2192 Travel 1 station.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move beyond the final station, you will be transferred to <strong>\u2018First\u2019 Stage</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your current location on the <strong>yellow Current Station Board.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>13 Endings\u00a0&amp; Achievements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice leads to one of <strong>13 unique endings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>13 achievements</strong> tied to each ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the endings you have obtained on <strong>the green Ending Tracker.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Observe, Deduce, Survive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe:</strong> Pay attention to unsettling anomalies at each station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deduce:</strong> Make the right decisions to advance to the next station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive:</strong> Escape the loop and uncover the truth before it consumes you.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A psychological horror puzzle game set in an eerie, endlessly repeating commute. Face mysterious anomalies, make crucial decisions, and uncover the truth as you strive to escape this seemingly endless loop.",
